00:42:13,340 --> 00:42:17,020
(It's okay to pause,
fall apart, and heal slowly)

1399
00:42:19,560 --> 00:42:21,840
Third, bribe the people Loading punished

1400
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:22,760
and have them play dead.

1401
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:24,640
That'll ruin Loading's reputation.

1402
00:42:24,700 --> 00:42:27,620
(ESC didn't kill the citizens
of Tui City)

1403
00:42:27,640 --> 00:42:29,520
That'll make their condition worse.

1404
00:42:29,520 --> 00:42:30,920
Then I can use their illness

1405
00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:32,800
to manipulate and torment them mentally,

1406
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:33,480
and destroy them,

1407
00:42:33,480 --> 00:42:33,920
bit by bit,

1408
00:42:33,920 --> 00:42:35,280
until they destroy themselves.

1409
00:42:35,560 --> 00:42:36,720
Aren't they the famous

1410
00:42:36,720 --> 00:42:37,680
Dark Web Vigilante,

1411
00:42:38,000 --> 00:42:38,680
Loading?

1412
00:42:38,680 --> 00:42:39,680
Let's see

1413
00:42:39,680 --> 00:42:42,080
who's better at revenge, me or them.

1414
00:42:42,760 --> 00:42:43,280
I can team up

1415
00:42:43,280 --> 00:42:44,320
with others Loading has punished

1416
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:45,280
who hate them too,

1417
00:42:45,280 --> 00:42:45,960
and together,

1418
00:42:45,960 --> 00:42:47,040
put on (an act).

1419
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:48,280
Fourth,

1420
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:49,240
one of them realized

1421
00:42:49,240 --> 00:42:50,080
something was wrong with the sanatorium.

1422
00:42:50,080 --> 00:42:51,000
ESC.

1423
00:42:51,440 --> 00:42:52,480
I tricked him into thinking

1424
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:54,040
the medicine he takes every day
is the problem.

1425
00:42:54,040 --> 00:42:55,080
He'd never guess

1426
00:42:55,080 --> 00:42:56,680
the entire treatment itself,

1427
00:42:56,680 --> 00:42:57,560
the Tui Healing Trilogy,

1428
00:42:57,560 --> 00:42:58,960
is completely wrong.

1429
00:42:59,600 --> 00:43:00,600
Everything we just talked about.

1430
00:43:00,600 --> 00:43:01,000
Exactly.

1431
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:03,840
That whole trilogy

1432
00:43:03,840 --> 00:43:04,560
and everything else

1433
00:43:04,560 --> 00:43:06,240
just keeps ripping open their wounds,

1434
00:43:06,240 --> 00:43:08,480
making them constantly
question themselves.

1435
00:43:08,480 --> 00:43:09,760
That's why we kept getting worse.

1436
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:11,280
Worse and worse.

1437
00:43:11,280 --> 00:43:12,800
It wasn't the medicine.

1438
00:43:14,040 --> 00:43:15,240
New world!

1439
00:43:15,240 --> 00:43:16,520
(Poisoned by the Tui Healing Trilogy)

1440
00:43:16,520 --> 00:43:17,100
(Dramatic use only. Do not imitate)
Goodbye.

1441
00:43:17,100 --> 00:43:19,200
(Li Attention was severely depressed
and took the blame for a friend)

1442
00:43:19,200 --> 00:43:20,260
(He ultimately chose to leave everyone)

1443
00:43:20,940 --> 00:43:22,260
(What really led Li Attention
to take his own life)

1444
00:43:22,260 --> 00:43:24,060
(Wasn't the EMO Fly Away medication)

1445
00:43:24,060 --> 00:43:25,580
(It was the Tui Healing Trilogy)

1446
00:43:25,580 --> 00:43:27,540
(Read ten thousand books,
travel ten thousand miles)

1447
00:43:27,880 --> 00:43:28,520
Let's recap.

1448
00:43:28,520 --> 00:43:30,440
We just uncovered three memories.

1449
00:43:30,720 --> 00:43:31,800
First, what did we find?

1450
00:43:31,800 --> 00:43:34,720
Let's look at Li Attention.

1451
00:43:34,720 --> 00:43:36,560
Why did he change the story?

1452
00:43:36,560 --> 00:43:38,020
(Why did Li Attention change the story?)

1453
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:42,840
Because he needed us
to give it a low score.

1454
00:43:43,680 --> 00:43:44,960
So he made the story terrible.

1455
00:43:45,600 --> 00:43:47,000
(March 24)
They came here to dream.

1456
00:43:47,000 --> 00:43:47,840
But now they can only

1457
00:43:47,840 --> 00:43:49,200
struggle through nightmare
after nightmare,

1458
00:43:49,680 --> 00:43:51,880
forced to give low scores
and leave the game.

1459
00:43:52,160 --> 00:43:53,320
Only with low scores

1460
00:43:53,320 --> 00:43:55,640
would the system detect a bug

1461
00:43:55,640 --> 00:43:56,840
or some other problem,

1462
00:43:56,840 --> 00:43:58,040
and kick us out.

1463
00:43:58,280 --> 00:43:59,520
But then he realized

1464
00:43:59,520 --> 00:44:00,680
we liked the challenges more and more.

1465
00:44:00,680 --> 00:44:01,560
We kept enjoying them,

1466
00:44:01,560 --> 00:44:02,480
and even gave high scores.

1467
00:44:02,480 --> 00:44:03,800
He couldn't understand it.

1468
00:44:04,080 --> 00:44:05,930
(May 26)
They only got more determined.

1469
00:44:05,960 --> 00:44:07,280
They even started loving detective work.

1470
00:44:07,280 --> 00:44:09,560
So I had to use

1471
00:44:09,560 --> 00:44:11,000
the traits of all seven players

1472
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:13,040
to trigger seven major bugs in the game.

1473
00:44:13,040 --> 00:44:14,640
I wanted to tell everyone the truth,

1474
00:44:14,640 --> 00:44:16,400
but while fixing those bugs,

1475
00:44:16,400 --> 00:44:18,240
I noticed something odd
about Designer Bai.

1476
00:44:18,720 --> 00:44:19,640
So he switched

1477
00:44:19,640 --> 00:44:20,520
to another plan.

1478
00:44:20,520 --> 00:44:21,880
And killed Designer Bai.

1479
00:44:24,600 --> 00:44:25,960
Designer Bai?

1480
00:44:26,400 --> 00:44:28,200
He was killed in the teleport pod.

1481
00:44:28,560 --> 00:44:30,680
And his real-life self
was "taken out" too.

1482
00:44:31,120 --> 00:44:33,600
Li Attention probably didn't know

1483
00:44:33,600 --> 00:44:35,240
what happened to us afterward.

1484
00:44:35,240 --> 00:44:36,480
He probably thought

1485
00:44:36,480 --> 00:44:37,600
we wanted to stay with him,

1486
00:44:37,600 --> 00:44:39,240
so we stayed in this game world.

1487
00:44:40,040 --> 00:44:41,560
That's why he wanted to get us out.

1488
00:44:41,560 --> 00:44:43,120
But from all the memories

1489
00:44:43,120 --> 00:44:44,200
we saw today,

1490
00:44:44,440 --> 00:44:45,800
once we got out,

1491
00:44:45,800 --> 00:44:48,400
we might end up
like Li Attention and hurt ourselves,

1492
00:44:48,800 --> 00:44:49,880
or do something to ourselves,

1493
00:44:49,880 --> 00:44:51,360
or ultimately face death.

1494
00:44:51,360 --> 00:44:52,120
Something like that.

1495
00:44:52,120 --> 00:44:54,560
So in a way, ESC

1496
00:44:54,560 --> 00:44:56,040
doesn't want us

1497
00:44:56,040 --> 00:44:57,440
to leave Door of Truth.

1498
00:44:57,680 --> 00:44:59,320
I already replaced
Li Attention's medicine

1499
00:44:59,320 --> 00:45:00,000
with sugar,

1500
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:01,200
but he still left us.

1501
00:45:01,200 --> 00:45:03,800
Did the medicine work
once he'd taken it?

1502
00:45:04,160 --> 00:45:05,840
I can't just watch everyone die.

1503
00:45:05,840 --> 00:45:06,480
We can still be saved.

1504
00:45:06,920 --> 00:45:09,080
They hope we can live well here.

1505
00:45:09,080 --> 00:45:10,400
Their intentions are good.

1506
00:45:10,400 --> 00:45:11,040
Right.

1507
00:45:11,040 --> 00:45:11,520
Exactly.

1508
00:45:11,520 --> 00:45:12,880
(ESC kept everyone in Door of Truth)
Because in real life,

1509
00:45:12,880 --> 00:45:14,280
(To save everyone)
we might already be in terrible shape,

1510
00:45:14,280 --> 00:45:15,560
right on the verge of breaking down.

1511
00:45:15,560 --> 00:45:16,880
He was scared once we got out, we'd...

1512
00:45:17,400 --> 00:45:18,120
I think that's

1513
00:45:18,120 --> 00:45:19,360
the whole...

1514
00:45:19,800 --> 00:45:20,520
Story.

1515
00:45:20,520 --> 00:45:21,000
The answer to the mystery.

1516
00:45:21,500 --> 00:45:22,180
(ESC memory fragment 3
reveals the secret)

1517
00:45:22,180 --> 00:45:22,800
(ESC found the sanatorium's
secret but got no help)

1518
00:45:22,800 --> 00:45:23,550
(To save his friends, he trapped
them in Door of Truth)

1519
00:45:23,550 --> 00:45:24,410
(ESC wrongly blamed the medicine
for worsening depression)

1520
00:45:24,420 --> 00:45:25,340
(He never realized Tui Healing Trilogy
was the real problem)

1521
00:45:25,800 --> 00:45:28,440
You've uncovered
the secret in the third memory.

1522
00:45:28,440 --> 00:45:29,680
The letter C has appeared.

1523
00:45:31,880 --> 00:45:32,720
You've unlocked

1524
00:45:32,720 --> 00:45:34,680
all of ESC's memories.

1525
00:45:34,680 --> 00:45:37,440
The logout button is being repaired.

1526
00:45:37,440 --> 00:45:38,840
Please wait.

1527
00:45:39,060 --> 00:45:41,740
(System repair in progress)

1528
00:45:41,920 --> 00:45:42,920
So can we log out?

1529
00:45:43,960 --> 00:45:45,080
It's still being repaired.

1530
00:45:45,080 --> 00:45:45,800
It's not done yet.

1531
00:45:45,800 --> 00:45:46,760
Do we have

1532
00:45:46,760 --> 00:45:47,960
to find that person first

1533
00:45:47,960 --> 00:45:49,400
before it can fully repair?

1534
00:45:49,400 --> 00:45:50,800
(Find ESC and the infected player
to log out?)

1535
00:45:50,800 --> 00:45:51,560
Those two people.

1536
00:45:53,960 --> 00:45:55,560
Alright. Let's head
to the teleport pod.

1537
00:45:55,560 --> 00:45:56,240
Let's go.

1538
00:45:58,960 --> 00:46:00,360
We're off, guys.

1539
00:46:00,360 --> 00:46:01,000
Let's go.

1540
00:46:01,000 --> 00:46:02,400
Big windmill!

1541
00:46:10,420 --> 00:46:12,980
Player transport complete.

1542
00:46:13,520 --> 00:46:14,080
Let's go.

1543
00:46:14,400 --> 00:46:14,840
Come on.

1544
00:46:14,840 --> 00:46:16,080
Let's go.

1545
00:46:21,320 --> 00:46:22,320
Test three people.

1546
00:46:24,240 --> 00:46:25,880
Three people must stand

1547
00:46:25,880 --> 00:46:27,000
in front of this detection mirror

1548
00:46:27,000 --> 00:46:27,680
for five seconds.

1549
00:46:27,680 --> 00:46:30,880
If ESC is among them,

1550
00:46:30,880 --> 00:46:32,120
or one of ESC's accomplices,

1551
00:46:32,120 --> 00:46:34,960
the mirror will crack.

1552
00:46:35,600 --> 00:46:36,600
Guys, there's more.

1553
00:46:37,120 --> 00:46:39,720
The only way to activate
the door to reality

1554
00:46:39,720 --> 00:46:43,160
is for four people to place
their palms on this scanner.

1555
00:46:43,440 --> 00:46:45,520
(Choose four to use the scanner)
If none is ESC

1556
00:46:45,520 --> 00:46:46,480
or an accomplice,

1557
00:46:46,480 --> 00:46:47,480
activation succeeds.

1558
00:46:47,480 --> 00:46:49,240
(ESC exit light shows the result)
The ESC light turns green.

1559
00:46:49,800 --> 00:46:51,360
(If none of the four is ESC or infected)
The door to reality will appear

1560
00:46:51,360 --> 00:46:52,440
(Green means success)
in the game lobby.

1561
00:46:52,440 --> 00:46:54,080
(If ESC or an infected is among them)
Otherwise, it fails.

1562
00:46:54,080 --> 00:46:56,280
(Red means failure)
The ESC light turns red.

1563
00:46:56,280 --> 00:46:57,440
The exit will be hidden forever.

1564
00:46:57,440 --> 00:46:58,840
Remember, you only get one chance.

1565
00:46:59,400 --> 00:47:00,560
Is this the final answer?

1566
00:47:00,560 --> 00:47:01,680
(Final verification zone)
Before the final answer,

1567
00:47:01,680 --> 00:47:03,320
(Trial zone)
we can test once, right?

1568
00:47:03,540 --> 00:47:06,500
(Timed vote begins)

1569
00:47:07,040 --> 00:47:08,680
We only get one chance.

1570
00:47:09,200 --> 00:47:10,440
Unfortunately,

1571
00:47:10,440 --> 00:47:11,920
you didn't finish the mission in time.

1572
00:47:12,400 --> 00:47:15,160
You lost your chance
to verify ESC's identity.

1573
00:47:15,800 --> 00:47:17,080
You didn't finish the mission in time.

1574
00:47:17,080 --> 00:47:19,400
You lost your chance
to verify ESC's identity.

1575
00:47:19,400 --> 00:47:20,780
(Only one of three DLC quests succeeded)

1576
00:47:20,960 --> 00:47:22,000
I think I should go.

1577
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:22,860
(Ding volunteers)

1578
00:47:23,040 --> 00:47:23,760
Then I'll go too.

1579
00:47:23,760 --> 00:47:24,960
(Nan Do volunteers)
Yeah, we're both going.

1580
00:47:24,960 --> 00:47:26,320
Why do you two have to go?

1581
00:47:26,600 --> 00:47:28,480
(Instantly heated)
Are we fighting already?

1582
00:47:29,080 --> 00:47:30,360
Why should you two go?

1583
00:47:31,520 --> 00:47:32,200
Hold on.

1584
00:47:32,200 --> 00:47:34,000
We're not there yet.

1585
00:47:34,320 --> 00:47:34,560
No.

1586
00:47:34,560 --> 00:47:35,720
It's their first time playing this.

1587
00:47:35,720 --> 00:47:36,320
They don't know.

1588
00:47:36,380 --> 00:47:37,820
(A little too eager)

1589
00:47:38,000 --> 00:47:38,760
Okay, it's fine.

1590
00:47:38,760 --> 00:47:39,560
How about this?

1591
00:47:39,560 --> 00:47:41,320
Any thoughts?

1592
00:47:41,320 --> 00:47:43,000
Who seems more likely?

1593
00:47:43,000 --> 00:47:44,120
Or less likely?

1594
00:47:44,120 --> 00:47:45,000
Let's hear it.

1595
00:47:45,440 --> 00:47:47,060
I say we send up three

1596
00:47:47,060 --> 00:47:47,780
(Ding suggests testing three good guys)
good guys.

1597
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:48,680
Of course.

1598
00:47:48,680 --> 00:47:49,200
Okay.

1599
00:47:49,440 --> 00:47:50,320
Three good guys?

1600
00:47:50,320 --> 00:47:50,920
Why?

1601
00:47:50,980 --> 00:47:51,920
(Confused)

1602
00:47:51,920 --> 00:47:54,440
If all three get green lights,

1603
00:47:54,440 --> 00:47:55,920
(Good guys)
then all three are good.

1604
00:47:56,450 --> 00:47:57,240
(Two bad guys out of three)
Two out of three.

1605
00:47:57,240 --> 00:47:57,680
Two out of three.

1606
00:47:58,040 --> 00:47:59,120
But if one's bad,

1607
00:47:59,120 --> 00:48:00,840
(Test failed)
and that light comes on,

1608
00:48:00,840 --> 00:48:03,280
(Identities unknown)
the other three could still all be good.

1609
00:48:03,280 --> 00:48:03,800
That's true.

1610
00:48:03,800 --> 00:48:04,520
Right?

1611
00:48:04,520 --> 00:48:05,920
There are only two bad guys.

1612
00:48:05,980 --> 00:48:07,820
(Time to use our brains)

1613
00:48:08,000 --> 00:48:09,720
So we want three good guys up there.

1614
00:48:09,720 --> 00:48:10,080
Right.

1615
00:48:10,080 --> 00:48:11,380
(Good guy right here)
Then I have to go.

1616
00:48:11,560 --> 00:48:12,600
(Instantly volunteers)
Then I have to go.

1617
00:48:13,040 --> 00:48:14,520
(Fired up again)
I'll stand right in the middle.

1618
00:48:14,720 --> 00:48:15,960
I'll stand on the inside.

1619
00:48:15,960 --> 00:48:16,840
Exactly. Come on.

1620
00:48:18,360 --> 00:48:20,160
We can just volunteer ourselves now?

1621
00:48:20,160 --> 00:48:22,400
Did you ask the three of us?

1622
00:48:24,120 --> 00:48:24,560
No.

1623
00:48:24,560 --> 00:48:25,720
I'm just saying.

1624
00:48:26,160 --> 00:48:26,560
Right.

1625
00:48:26,560 --> 00:48:27,800
(There you go rushing again)

1626
00:48:27,800 --> 00:48:28,400
So worked up.

1627
00:48:29,000 --> 00:48:30,040
Rushing.

1628
00:48:30,400 --> 00:48:31,760
Yeah, you're right about everything.

1629
00:48:32,320 --> 00:48:33,400
Fine, that's me today.

1630
00:48:33,680 --> 00:48:35,040
(He Da imitation mode)
You're right.

1631
00:48:35,040 --> 00:48:35,840
Okay, come on.

1632
00:48:36,320 --> 00:48:37,880
Wait.

1633
00:48:38,560 --> 00:48:38,920
Right.

1634
00:48:39,360 --> 00:48:40,840
That's exactly how he was last season.

1635
00:48:40,840 --> 00:48:42,440
Go on. Get up.

1636
00:48:43,360 --> 00:48:43,680
You guys...

1637
00:48:43,680 --> 00:48:44,600
(Wait)
Aren't you three going?

1638
00:48:44,600 --> 00:48:46,320
Just go.

1639
00:48:46,520 --> 00:48:46,960
Why?

1640
00:48:46,960 --> 00:48:48,760
(Wait)
I already changed my vote.

1641
00:48:48,920 --> 00:48:50,560
You keep agreeing with everything.

1642
00:48:50,560 --> 00:48:52,440
Then when it's your turn to go up,

1643
00:48:52,440 --> 00:48:54,140
(The 1:1:1 replay)
you're like, "Wait, I don't get it".

1644
00:48:54,560 --> 00:48:55,880
Last season, you were just

1645
00:48:55,940 --> 00:48:57,140
cheating.

1646
00:48:57,360 --> 00:48:58,680
It's fine. I'll take the criticism.

1647
00:48:58,680 --> 00:48:59,040
Come on.

1648
00:48:59,480 --> 00:49:01,560
Why don't we just carry him up there?

1649
00:49:01,560 --> 00:49:02,760
(Confused)
No, that's just how he is.

1650
00:49:02,760 --> 00:49:04,200
I'm good. I won't accept this.

1651
00:49:04,560 --> 00:49:05,120
I don't care.

1652
00:49:05,120 --> 00:49:06,480
I'll drag him up myself.

1653
00:49:06,480 --> 00:49:07,780
(Forced test)

1654
00:49:08,000 --> 00:49:08,560
Here's the thing.

1655
00:49:08,560 --> 00:49:11,080
First, we need to piece together

1656
00:49:11,080 --> 00:49:12,360
all our leads.

1657
00:49:12,360 --> 00:49:14,240
We went through three

1658
00:49:14,240 --> 00:49:15,000
memory fragments today.

1659
00:49:15,000 --> 00:49:16,600
Can we rule anyone out?

1660
00:49:16,920 --> 00:49:18,360
I've been looking at this.

1661
00:49:18,360 --> 00:49:19,400
(Evidence collected)
Look.

1662
00:49:19,840 --> 00:49:20,320
First,

1663
00:49:20,320 --> 00:49:22,400
it said to call my family.

1664
00:49:22,400 --> 00:49:23,440
(Family)
That came up a lot.

1665
00:49:23,440 --> 00:49:24,680
Then the second time,

1666
00:49:24,680 --> 00:49:26,200
(Find family)
it said to tell my family the truth

1667
00:49:26,200 --> 00:49:27,120
