weren't such a big deal after all.

2751
01:20:33,000 --> 01:20:34,280
That's also one way
of dealing with things.

2752
01:20:34,280 --> 01:20:34,840
Yes.

2753
01:20:34,840 --> 01:20:37,320
Whether you choose
to keep moving forward

2754
01:20:37,320 --> 01:20:38,400
or stay where you are for a while,

2755
01:20:38,400 --> 01:20:39,400
there's no right or wrong choice.

2756
01:20:39,920 --> 01:20:40,800
As friends,

2757
01:20:40,800 --> 01:20:43,320
we respect everyone's choices.

2758
01:20:43,560 --> 01:20:43,920
Of course.

2759
01:20:44,600 --> 01:20:47,360
Respect and acceptance
are the best outcome.

2760
01:20:47,360 --> 01:20:47,680
Yes.

2761
01:20:48,960 --> 01:20:51,800
Besides, they can always press ESC

2762
01:20:51,800 --> 01:20:53,200
and come and go whenever they want.

2763
01:20:53,200 --> 01:20:53,520
Right.

2764
01:20:53,520 --> 01:20:53,960
Right?

2765
01:20:53,960 --> 01:20:54,200
Right.

2766
01:20:54,940 --> 01:20:55,400
(Force ESC first.)

2767
01:20:55,400 --> 01:20:55,800
Come out.

2768
01:20:57,920 --> 01:20:58,880
Come out.

2769
01:20:58,880 --> 01:21:01,000
What are you dreaming about?
Why are you smiling like that?

2770
01:21:01,290 --> 01:21:02,320
(Trying to wake someone who's pretending to sleep)
He won't come out.

2771
01:21:02,320 --> 01:21:03,040
Come out.

2772
01:21:03,040 --> 01:21:05,280
He must be dreaming
about Longdong Army in there.

2773
01:21:05,600 --> 01:21:06,600
Longdong Army.

2774
01:21:07,920 --> 01:21:08,940
Longdong Army.

2775
01:21:08,940 --> 01:21:10,460
(The secret wake-up phrase: Longdong Army)
Longdong Army!

2776
01:21:10,480 --> 01:21:11,880
Who shouted that familiar slogan

2777
01:21:11,880 --> 01:21:12,800
and woke me up?

2778
01:21:15,400 --> 01:21:18,960
Our two friends, Ning 2K and Ke Cutie,

2779
01:21:18,960 --> 01:21:20,720
chose to stay in this world.

2780
01:21:20,720 --> 01:21:22,160
I think your life belongs to you.

2781
01:21:22,160 --> 01:21:24,080
How you choose to live it
is entirely up to you.

2782
01:21:24,640 --> 01:21:26,200
You can do what is right,

2783
01:21:26,200 --> 01:21:28,400
or you can do what you believe is right.

2784
01:21:28,400 --> 01:21:29,160
So,

2785
01:21:29,160 --> 01:21:30,520
just like Jin said earlier,

2786
01:21:30,520 --> 01:21:31,280
as your friends,

2787
01:21:31,760 --> 01:21:33,520
we'll always respect your choices.

2788
01:21:33,520 --> 01:21:34,680
That's what true friendship is.

2789
01:21:34,680 --> 01:21:35,040
Right.

2790
01:21:35,040 --> 01:21:35,520
Isn't that right?

2791
01:21:35,520 --> 01:21:35,880
Exactly.

2792
01:21:35,880 --> 01:21:36,280
Good friends

2793
01:21:36,280 --> 01:21:38,160
should each be able
to take control of their own lives

2794
01:21:38,160 --> 01:21:40,040
and make the choices they want.

2795
01:21:40,040 --> 01:21:40,680
There's no right or wrong.

2796
01:21:40,680 --> 01:21:42,400
Whether you choose to live bravely

2797
01:21:42,400 --> 01:21:44,520
or simply follow your heart,

2798
01:21:44,520 --> 01:21:45,160
neither choice is wrong.

2799
01:21:45,160 --> 01:21:46,760
So I hope

2800
01:21:46,760 --> 01:21:47,120
we can all be happy.

2801
01:21:47,640 --> 01:21:48,160
Yes.

2802
01:21:49,000 --> 01:21:49,560
Happy.

