Please wait...

2808
01:22:12,360 --> 01:22:13,960
What's going on?
Did you get stuck in a bug too?

2809
01:22:13,960 --> 01:22:15,600
Didn't we return to reality?

2810
01:22:15,600 --> 01:22:16,600
Don't tell me...

2811
01:22:17,600 --> 01:22:18,840
We never made it back?

2812
01:22:19,220 --> 01:22:25,020
(They're still in the game.)

2813
01:22:25,320 --> 01:22:27,080
We've really been trapped in this world.

2814
01:22:39,560 --> 01:22:40,160
What's going on?

2815
01:22:41,440 --> 01:22:43,080
Is there something wrong
with the circuit?

2816
01:22:46,840 --> 01:22:47,200
No.

2817
01:22:47,200 --> 01:22:48,560
It's a code.

2818
01:22:48,560 --> 01:22:49,320
Morse code.

2819
01:22:49,380 --> 01:22:51,420
(Morse Code)

2820
01:22:53,520 --> 01:22:54,320
What does it mean?

2821
01:22:54,320 --> 01:22:56,440
Is someone trying to transmit something?

2822
01:22:57,160 --> 01:22:58,160
Could this electrical malfunction

2823
01:22:58,160 --> 01:22:59,800
actually be someone
sending a distress signal?

2824
01:23:00,320 --> 01:23:00,840
Maybe.

2825
01:23:05,080 --> 01:23:05,680
One.

2826
01:23:05,680 --> 01:23:06,200
One, two.

2827
01:23:11,800 --> 01:23:13,320
I don't think the flashing pattern

2828
01:23:13,320 --> 01:23:14,560
has anything to do with it.

2829
01:23:14,560 --> 01:23:15,200
It does.

2830
01:23:16,620 --> 01:23:17,340
Help...

2831
01:23:17,520 --> 01:23:18,000
Help...

2832
01:23:18,000 --> 01:23:18,800
Help?

2833
01:23:22,980 --> 01:23:23,580
Help...

2834
01:23:27,960 --> 01:23:28,600
Help...

2835
01:23:30,000 --> 01:23:30,640
Help...

2836
01:23:33,100 --> 01:23:36,300
(Help me.)

2837
01:23:42,240 --> 01:23:42,840
What the hell?

