Let's dig in.

2907
01:26:08,680 --> 01:26:09,920
Thanks. Time to eat.

2908
01:26:09,920 --> 01:26:12,320
This lotus root is seriously delicious.

2909
01:26:12,320 --> 01:26:13,560
This soup is really good.

2910
01:26:13,560 --> 01:26:14,440
It's so flavorful.

2911
01:26:15,320 --> 01:26:16,280
These noodles are so good.

2912
01:26:16,280 --> 01:26:18,680
This is my first time
having white fish that's slightly sweet.

2913
01:26:18,680 --> 01:26:21,680
Ding, what's the best thing
you've eaten this season?

2914
01:26:21,900 --> 01:26:22,310
That...

2915
01:26:22,310 --> 01:26:22,860
(Confidential)

2916
01:26:24,760 --> 01:26:26,040
Because something special like that

2917
01:26:26,040 --> 01:26:27,280
is actually what makes it unforgettable.

2918
01:26:27,280 --> 01:26:28,280
Then what do you want to eat the most?

2919
01:26:28,280 --> 01:26:28,800
(Confidential)

2920
01:26:28,800 --> 01:26:30,240
From now on, let's just order
one huge table full of food.

2921
01:26:30,240 --> 01:26:30,520
Then you can...

2922
01:26:30,520 --> 01:26:31,360
(Confidential)

2923
01:26:31,360 --> 01:26:33,000
I ordered it for everyone.

2924
01:26:33,000 --> 01:26:34,280
But only on the condition

2925
01:26:34,280 --> 01:26:35,800
that I get to eat
what you guys order too.

2926
01:26:37,000 --> 01:26:38,240
Look at these guys.

2927
01:26:38,360 --> 01:26:39,520
(Memories Flooding Back.
Getting Carried Away)

2928
01:26:39,520 --> 01:26:41,280
The most handsome moment was also...

2929
01:26:41,280 --> 01:26:43,200
The moment I want to preserve most is...

2930
01:26:43,200 --> 01:26:45,840
The most memorable moment
would have to be that...

2931
01:26:45,840 --> 01:26:47,040
Which one?

2932
01:26:47,040 --> 01:26:48,680
That day left
the deepest impression on me.

2933
01:26:48,680 --> 01:26:49,400
What do you mean by that?

2934
01:26:51,640 --> 01:26:53,000
What exactly are you implying?

2935
01:26:53,000 --> 01:26:54,960
This moment didn't actually appear

2936
01:26:54,960 --> 01:26:56,320
in the main episode of our show.

2937
01:26:56,320 --> 01:26:57,920
Zhou Keyu,

2938
01:26:57,920 --> 01:26:59,240
I think you're pretty much
the same as me.

2939
01:26:59,240 --> 01:27:01,000
At least I've changed, okay?

2940
01:27:01,000 --> 01:27:02,240
How am I the same as you?

2941
01:27:02,240 --> 01:27:03,600
We didn't force him.

2942
01:27:03,600 --> 01:27:04,120
I didn't.

2943
01:27:04,120 --> 01:27:05,720
We didn't grab him by the neck

2944
01:27:05,720 --> 01:27:06,480
on the plane

2945
01:27:06,480 --> 01:27:07,360
and hold his bag while saying...

2946
01:27:07,360 --> 01:27:07,840
(Confidential)

2947
01:27:07,840 --> 01:27:08,800
See? I'm still different.

2948
01:27:08,800 --> 01:27:09,200
Not really.

2949
01:27:09,200 --> 01:27:10,320
I'm not listening.

2950
01:27:10,480 --> 01:27:13,240
To this day, not a single person
has found the crucial clue.

2951
01:27:13,240 --> 01:27:14,360
What a shame.

2952
01:27:14,680 --> 01:27:16,680
So we've specially opened a chance
to make up for that regret.

2953
01:27:16,680 --> 01:27:18,520
If you find it, you'll receive...

2954
01:27:18,760 --> 01:27:19,800
If it was right in front of us

2955
01:27:19,800 --> 01:27:20,680
and we still couldn't find it...

2956
01:27:20,680 --> 01:27:23,160
We seriously need to put some
protective padding around the house.

2957
01:27:23,160 --> 01:27:24,440
If it's not meant to be mine,
it'll never be mine.

2958
01:27:24,440 --> 01:27:25,600
We're not finding it today either.

2959
01:27:25,720 --> 01:27:26,520
There's no way we'll find it.

