If there's an escape room today,

2978
01:27:55,760 --> 01:27:57,280
I'm definitely going in first.

2979
01:27:57,640 --> 01:27:59,600
(Absolutely Satisfied)
Bro, we'll definitely give you room to grow.

2980
01:27:59,720 --> 01:28:01,200
