Basically, we need to bend the rules a little.

2982
01:28:03,000 --> 01:28:04,560
I'll say "black magic".

2983
01:28:04,920 --> 01:28:06,240
Blue? Blue goes like this.

2984
01:28:06,240 --> 01:28:07,200
(Let's Try It First)

2985
01:28:07,200 --> 01:28:07,760
Blue.

2986
01:28:07,920 --> 01:28:09,560
We're basically just trying
to outsmart the production team.

